{"name":"Abyss","hex":"#8f9e9d","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"abyss","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Hell; the bottomless pit; primeval chaos; a confined subterranean ocean. .mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}","A bottomless or unfathomed depth, gulf, or chasm; hence, any deep, immeasurable; any void space."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/abyss"}],"entries":[{"title":"Abyss (religion)","blocks":[{"text":"In the Bible, the abyss is an unfathomably deep or boundless place. The term comes from the Greek word abyssos, meaning \"deep, unfathomable, boundless\". It is used as both an adjective and a noun. It appears in the Septuagint, which is the earliest Greek translation of the Hebrew Bible, and in the New Testament."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Abyss_(religion)"},{"title":"Abyss (Thelema)","blocks":[{"text":"In Thelema, the Abyss represents a metaphysical concept that signifies the great chasm or void separating the manifest world from its divine source. Aleister Crowley, the founder of Thelema, extensively explored and integrated this concept into his esoteric teachings, imbuing it with deep spiritual significance."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Abyss_(Thelema)"},{"title":"Abyss (roller coaster)","blocks":[{"text":"Abyss is a steel roller coaster located at the Adventure World amusement park in Perth, Western Australia. The $12-million attraction was announced in April 2013, and construction began the following month. It opened to the general public six months later on 1 November 2013."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/6/6f/Abyss_logo.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Abyss_(roller_coaster)"},{"title":"Abyss (wrestler)","blocks":[{"text":"Christopher Joseph Parks, better known by his ring name Abyss, is an American retired professional wrestler, who has been employed by WWE as a producer since January 2019. He is best known for his time with Total Nonstop Action Wrestling (TNA)."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cc/Abyss_posing_at_Alpha1.jpg/330px-Abyss_posing_at_Alpha1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Abyss_(wrestler)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0f/Abyss_%28Adventure_World%29_1.jpg/500px-Abyss_%28Adventure_World%29_1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0f/Abyss_%28Adventure_World%29_1.jpg/1280px-Abyss_%28Adventure_World%29_1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0f/Abyss_%28Adventure_World%29_1.jpg/500px-Abyss_%28Adventure_World%29_1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AAbyss_(Adventure_World)_1.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/32/Michael_Sain_vs._Abyss.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 1x","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/32/Michael_Sain_vs._Abyss.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","alt":"Abyss (masked) wrestling against Michael Sain","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AMichael_Sain_vs._Abyss.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3a/Chris_Parks_-_Abyss_backstage_in_Carbondale.jpg/500px-Chris_Parks_-_Abyss_backstage_in_Carbondale.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3a/Chris_Parks_-_Abyss_backstage_in_Carbondale.jpg/1280px-Chris_Parks_-_Abyss_backstage_in_Carbondale.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign